Revision history for WPDCS

2.0.0  2026-09-23
  - New tag standard v2.0: param, return, throws, ex, ex-fail, see,
    deprecated, todo, test, complexity (legacy excode-* still parsed)
  - New commands: test (executable doctests), stats (coverage),
    gen test (skeleton .t from @ex), all with --json
  - Recursive file/dir arguments with .wpdcsrc exclude_dirs
  - gen funcinfo infers @param from Perl signatures, my(@_), Clojure vectors
  - docs grouped per function with real names, see-links, index via --out
  - Checker reports unknown/malformed/duplicate tags; Linter validates
    param format and unknown tags, skips Makefile recipe tabs
  - House style pass: all comments live inside tags, tag prose is
    lowercase with no apostrophes, code/paths/emails/versions untouched
  - Full test suite in t/ (prove), CI workflow, man page, META.json

1.1.0  2026-09-23
  - Parser handles hyphenated tags, bare values, inline tags, secstart markers
  - Checker without exit(), Config loader, Core file helpers
  - Linter checks tabs/CRLF/length/EOF, Makefile-aware format
  - gen header preserves shebang, funcinfo supports defn + multiline subs
  - Fixed install-user PERL5LIB path, dist contents, README standard

1.0-SNAP  2026-05-17
  - Initial toolchain: parse, check, init, create, gen, lint, format, docs
